      "value": "@{65f4b1a3d0a7a0c657a7d3a8|full_name}I have sent my avatar ID via Help. Please check it.\n\n#695277\n\nTo check the feature, go to “Expressions” > “ガチ恋シェーダー” > “オン.”\n\nThe feature is designed so that the darker the view becomes, the closer the Receiver attached to your head gets to the Sender on another avatar.",
